notes.content:
[b]1、 Content adjustment[/b]
[list]
[*] It can be resurrected after the first death in low difficulty;
[*] You can unlock heroes with magic crystals;
[*] Increase the bonus of magic crystal in adventure mode. The lower the difficulty, the more it increases;
[*] Increase the reward of training dummys in adventure mode by 50% over the original;
[*] Two new cards can be unlocked for any adventure victory.
[/list]

[b]2、Bugs[/b]
Fixed 5 bugs about cards, items and achievements.

Last updated on 20th Dec 2019.
Event
1、	Added 3 new events: Adventurer’s Storehouse, Magic Crystal Mine, Tomb of the Brave.
-[ Adventurer’s Storehouse]: You can exchange your card here with those card left by other players.
-[ Magic Crystal Mine]: Scramble for chunks of Magic Crystal.
-[ Tomb of the Brave]:Other player’s grave. You can rummage for something useful, or show respect.
2、	Optimized some events;
Cards
1、[Crystal Sphere] : changed rarity Epic to Rare;
2、[Flamedragon's Horn] :  changed rarity Rare to Epic;
3、[Snake Gloves] : changed from 3 cost to 2 cost;
4、[Leading Spear] : changed from 3 cost to 2 cost;
5、[Cursed Eye] : changed from 2 cost to 1 cost;
6、[Wind Crossbow]: effect changed to "Whenever a friendly Token enters or leaves the battlefield." ; 
7、[Mini Catapult] : changed to “1 cost(0 cost after upgrade):Destroy a friendly minion, and deal damage equal to its Attack  to the enemy.”;
8、[Naga Sea Witch]: lower the HP from 16 to 14. Upgrade this card won’t get Attack and HP bonus now;
9、[Breeze Charmer] : fixed a bug that cause Breeze Charmer won’t work correctly;
10、[Titan of Sea] : fixed a text problem.
Items
Added 8 new items.
1、[Air-dried Starfish] ：At the start of each combat, if your HP is lower than 50%, draw 2(3 after upgrade) additional cards;
2、 [Treant Sprout] : At the start of each combat, if your HP is lower than 50%, max mana +1(and mana +1 after upgrade);
3、[Herbal Pouch]: At your first turn, whenever you use a card, HP+2(+4 after upgrade) ;
4、[Arcane Matryoshka]: At your first turn, whenever you use a non-token card, put a copy of it into your hand;
5、[Adventure Diary]: if you hold this item, you will get 150(300 after upgrade) bonus Proficiency.
6、[Holly Ritual Ring]: (Shaman only) Curse can now be played. Whenever you play a Curse, HP +1. Future card rewards have 1 less cards to choose from;
7、[Voodoo Pipe]: (Mage only) Curse cards can now be played. Whenever you play a Curse, deal 1 damage to the opponent;
8、[Crimson Coral]: (Witch only) Curse can now be played. Whenever you play a Curse, draw a card. Future card rewards have 1 less cards to choose from.
Others
1、Fixed the bug that when AI immolated Curse cards, it occasionally make game break down;
2、New year, new version and new looks for following monsters: (Diamond Dragon, Master of Arcane, Time Magician, Forest Dwarf, Abaddon Devil of War, Geomancer, Fel Sorcerer, Mammon Devil of Famine, Elven Ranger, The Curator, Blue Drake, Green Drake, Flame Spirit.);
3、Fixed some achievement text that doesn’t read smoothly;
4、Fixed the bug that sometimes the tips of Moon Well will be blocked by map elements;
5、Lower the price of [Purify] and [Purify(Greater)] in “Runestones”.

1、Added Battle Video speed adjustment. Now you can adjust Battle Video speed in Setting. There are "Normal Speed/Fast Speed/Extreme Speed" for you to choose;
2、Added Restart bottom. Now you can Restart current battle in Menu;
3、Difficulty is no longer unlocked one by one. Now when you complete specific difficulty, you will unlock a few difficulty at once;
4、Adjusted statistical method of Proficiency，and you can check details of Proficiency  statistics;
5、Now Leader-board also shows difficulty, and order by difficulty; 
6、Added some commonly used hotkey;
7、Recreated Hive interface map; 
8、Recreated Loot interface; 
9、Recreated Event interface;
Cards
1、[The Whisperer] changed to "Give your minions 'Whenever it attacks the enemy hero, heal 3(4 after upgrade) HP'.";
2、[Flower Fairy] changed to "(1): Heal a random damaged friendly minion for 4 (6 after upgrade) HP.";
3、 [Phenix] changed to "(1): Suicide. Deathrattle: Deal its Attack damage to all enemies.";
4、[Chimaera] ability cost changed to (1), and effect changed to "Deal damage equal to the total number of both hero’s Mana to the enemy hero." after upgrade.
5、[Abyssal Demon] changed to have 3 Attack and 14 HP, upgrade effect changed to "basic Attack +1";
6、[Breeze Charmer] changed to " Whenever a friendly non-token minion leaves the battlefield, summon a [Wind Spirit]( [Wind Spirit+] after upgrade) in situ."
7、 [Dragonute Mentor] changed to 3 cost and have 3 Attack and 14 HP.
8、 [Shapeshifter] ability cost changed to (2), basic Attack +1;
9、[Windwalker] changed to "Whenever a friendly minion is Returnhanded, add a [Whirlwind]( [Whirlwind+] after upgrade) to your hand."
10、 [Deviate Moccasin] changed to triggered at the beginning of your turn;
11、 [Overload+]changed to "Remove the top 5 cards of your opponent's deck.";
12、 [Dimensional Leap] changed to 3 cost;
13、 [Mystic's Sphere]changed to 1 cost;
14、[Healing Cape] changed to triggered at end of controller’s turn;
15、 [Dragon Hunter] fixed the bug that caused its ability not be triggered when get into battlefield;
16、 [Charm Siren] fixed the bug that its ability not be triggered when it die;

17、 [Goblin Shaman] fixed the bug that it can choose enemy as target;
18、 [Hurricane Golem] fixed the bug that its Attack is not refreshed in time;
19、 [Tauren Chieftain] fixed the bug that it will fight back during controller’s own turn;
20、 [Ice Worm] fixed the bug that when it dies, [Ice Knight]'s ability is not triggered;
21、 [Lava Spawn] fixed the bug that when token [Lava Spawn] dies, damage triggered correctly but there is no animation effect;
22、 [Enraging Assault] fixed the bug that minion will attack before add Attack.
Items
1、[Treatment Agent] changed to "At the start of each combat, HP +3(+6 after upgrade).";
2、 [Life Essence] changed to "Whenever you lose a [Curse] outside combats, HP +20%(40% after upgrade).";
3、 [Snake Purse] changed to "Double future Gold you gain. Your Max HP -16."
4、 [Cursed Coin] changed to "Whenever you obtain a [Curse] outside combats, gain 60 Gold.";
5、[Witchcraft Notes] changed to "Whenever you obtain a [Curse] outside combats, XP +40.";
6、[Charred Behemoth Meat] changed to "Max HP +22. Halve all future HP recovery effects outside combats.";
7、 [Gold Gloves] changed to "Whenever you lose HP outside combats, gain 40(80 after upgrade) Gold.";
8、 [Voodoo Woodcut] changed to "At the start of each combat, heal 2 HP for each [Curse] in your deck.";
9、 [Strange Potion] changed to "When getting it, HP +100%, obtain 1 random [Curse].";
10、[Witchcraft Tent] changed to "Your hero skill turns to "All enemy cards cost (4) more and all enemy skills cannot be used next turn".";
11、[Snake Soup] changed to "When getting it, Max HP +1 and HP +100%."(Now the healing  will be affected by other effects.);
12、[Boom Barrel] fixed description, now it is "At the start of each combat, deal 5 damage to the opponent. It increases by 1 for each [Curse] in your deck.";
Event
1、Fixed the bug that [Titanic Ward+] got in Event doesn't have Innate;
2、Optimized initial event [Dragon Hunter];
Achievement 
1、Fixed the bug that players can achieve [Last Judgment],
[The Reaper] and [Cursed! Cursed! ];
2、Add a "synchronized to Steam" button to Achievement interface. Now player can manually make achieve synchronized to Steam;
3、Slightly raise the requirement to achieve [Dragon Hunter?]

Boss
1、Be careful of [Abaddon, Devil of War], he is a little stronger now; 
2、Optimized some AI problem.
Others
1、Fixed the bug that when you make [Purify] and [Purify(Greater)], it occasionally doesn't take effect;
2、Fixed the bug that [Forgotten Scroll] doesn't take effect in some particular situation;
3、Fixed some untranslated text;
4、Fixed the bug that when scroll at Loot interface, the page number will be covered;
5、Fixed the bug that some button will occasionally be highlight state;
 6、All interface that you get card can check the upgrade effect now;
7、Added some new pattern of mouse pointer;
8、Updated some monsters' ability icon;
9、Fixed the problem that some interface doesn't scroll smoothly.
10、Changed [Innate] tag to [Portable] to make it different from [Inherent].


---------------------------------------------（中文版）-------------------------------------

一、功能
1、战斗加速功能可选择“普通/快速/极速”3种模式；
2、战斗内可以直接点开菜单选择“重新战斗”；
3、难度等级不再逐一开放，改为通关指定难度后批量开放；
4、修改了熟练度统计方式，并且可以查看熟练度统计的详情；
5、积分排行榜增加难度显示，并按难度优先排序；
6、增加部分常用快捷键操作；
7、重制蜂巢界面地图；
8、重制“搜刮战利品”界面；
9、重制“事件弹窗”界面；

二、卡牌：
1、【低语者】改为：“所有己方生物攻击对手时，生命+3（升级后+4）”；
2、【花仙子】改为：“（1）：随机使一个己方受伤的生物生命+4（升级后+6）”；
3、【火凤凰】改为：“（1）：牺牲。死亡时，给对手及其生物都造成等同于攻击的伤害”；
4、【奇美拉】的技能降为1费，升级后改为：“给对手造成双方剩余法力之和的伤害”；
5、【深渊恶魔】改为3攻14血，升级后改为“基础攻击+1”；
6、【风灵使】改为：“己方非衍生的生物离场时，在原位置衍生【风精灵】（升级后衍生【风精灵+】）”；
7、【龙人教官】改为：3费3攻14血；
8、【龙人变形师】技能改为2费，基础攻击+1；
9、【风行者】改为：“每当己方生物回手时，获得1张【旋风】（升级后获得【旋风+】）”；
10、【北海异蛇】改为：“每个己方回合开始时触发”；
11、【超负荷+】改为：“移除敌方牌库顶的5张牌”；
12、【空间跃迁】改为3费；
13、【魔法水晶球】改为1费；
14、【治疗斗篷】改为：“己方回合结束时触发”；
15、修复了【猎龙人】进场时偶尔没生效的BUG；
16、修复了【魅惑海妖+】死亡时没有生效的BUG；
17、修复了【哥布林萨满+】可以选择敌方目标的BUG；
18、修复了【飓风魔偶】攻击力有时候没有及时刷新的BUG；
19、修复了【牛头人酋长】在己方回合也会反击BUG；
20、修复了【冰虫】死亡时，【冰雪骑士】没有生效的BUG；
21、修复了衍生的【岩浆怪】死亡时，触发伤害但没有法球的BUG；
22、修复了【怒袭+】先攻击再加攻的BUG。

三、冒险道具：
1、【治疗药剂】改为：“战斗开始后，生命+3（升级后+6）”；
2、【生命精华】改为：“每当你在战斗外失去[诅咒卡]，生命+20%（升级后+40%）”；
3、【蛇皮钱袋】改为：“获得的金币翻倍。生命上限-16”；
4、【诅咒金币】改为：“每当你在战斗外获得1张[诅咒卡]，金币+60（升级后+120）”；
5、【巫法笔记】改为：“每当你在战斗外获得1张[诅咒卡]，经验+40（升级后+80）”；
6、【烤焦的比蒙肉】改为：“生命上限+22。所有战斗外的回复效果减半”；
7、【金丝手套】改为：“每当你在战斗外失去生命，金币+40（升级后+80）”；
8、【巫毒木刻】改为：“战斗开始后，牌组中每有1张诅咒卡，生命+2”；
9、【怪味药水】改为：“获得或升级本天赋时，生命+100%，获得1张诅咒卡”；
10、【巫术帐篷】改为：“英雄技能替换为[对手每次使用手牌时需额外消耗4点法力，且不能使用技能]”；
11、【蛇羹】由“回复所有生命”改为“生命+100%”（修改后回复效果会被其他道具所影响）；
12、修复了【炸药桶+】的描述BUG。

四、事件：
1、修复了获得事件中获得的[泰坦结界+]没有[原生]的BUG；
2、略微调整了初始事件【猎龙记忆】；

五、关卡
1、略微加强了【战争恶魔-亚巴顿】；
2、修改了部分AI的BUG；

六、成就：
1、修复了【末日审判】、【恐怖收割】和【厄运缠身】无法获得BUG；
2、成就界面增加“同步到Steam”的按钮，可手动同步成就；
3、稍微提升了【装备大师】的达成条件；

七、其他：
1、修复了魔晶制作“净化“和”净化（强效）”时，偶尔不生效的BUG；
2、修复了“遗忘卷轴”对在某些情况不生效的BUG；
3、修复了部分内容未翻译的问题（地精商店和符石制作）；
4、修复了收集界面进行滑动时候，页码被遮挡的问题；
5、修复了部分按钮偶尔会一直处于高亮状态的BUG；
6、所有获得卡牌的界面界面都可以查看“升级后的效果”；
7、增加部分鼠标的变化形态；
8、更新部分怪物的技能图标；
9、修复了部分界面滑动不流畅的问题；
